Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}Why did they curse them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.78,0:00:04.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}Allah says ...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:07.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}They were very sinful people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:08.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.98,0:00:12.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}They went beyond the limits\Nof Allah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.92,0:00:14.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}When Allah sets a limit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.38,0:00:15.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}they violate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.22,0:00:17.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}When Allah sets a limit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:18.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}they violate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.74,0:00:20.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}They were cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:23.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}They were sinful people\Nviolating the limits
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:25.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}of Allah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}Allah says ...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.44,0:00:30.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}At that time these people,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.67,0:00:31.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}Bani Israel,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.02,0:00:33.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:37.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}When they violated the limits\Nof Allah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.98,0:00:39.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}others who are not violating,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.29,0:00:40.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}who saw it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:41.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.36,0:00:42.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}They will not tell them,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.46,0:00:43.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}stop what you are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.74,0:00:44.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}What you are doing is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.90,0:00:46.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}No, they will not stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.02,0:00:49.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}They will not stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.44,0:00:50.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:52.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}It's a thing not to stop\Nevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.94,0:00:55.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}You see, you have the\Nability.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.98,0:00:58.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:01.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}Stop it with your hand if you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.32,0:01:02.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}are capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.14,0:01:05.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}And if you are not,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.78,0:01:07.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:10.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}If the individual is not\Nable,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:12.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}because of authority, to stop\Nit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.46,0:01:14.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.00,0:01:17.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}You should speak against it\Nnow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:20.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}And if you are still not\Nable,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.93,0:01:22.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}may Allah protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:25.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}You should hate it with your\Nheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:29.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}Hating it with your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.62,0:01:30.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}You hate that, that kind of a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:31.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}thing never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.14,0:01:35.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}And that is from the weakest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:40.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1238)}May Allah protect us.

